WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:15.711
Detective Smith was at his nephew's birthday party.

2
00:00:17.112 --> 00:00:18.113
A man was performing.

3
00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:20.894
"My name is Chuck," the man said.

4
00:00:21.915 --> 00:00:23.476
He moved a large doll on his lap.

5
00:00:23.496 --> 00:00:25.296
"And this is Chuckles.

6
00:00:25.617 --> 00:00:26.557
Say hello, Chuckles."

7
00:00:27.638 --> 00:00:28.718
"Hello, Chuckles."

8
00:00:29.419 --> 00:00:31.420
Chuck tried to pretend that Chuckles was talking.

9
00:00:32.424 --> 00:00:33.845
"Your mouth is moving!"

10
00:00:33.865 --> 00:00:34.945
a girl said.

11
00:00:34.965 --> 00:00:37.646
"This show stinks," a boy said.

12
00:00:38.627 --> 00:00:39.547
Chuck kept talking.

13
00:00:40.127 --> 00:00:41.528
"You're not good at this, Chuck.

14
00:00:42.288 --> 00:00:43.689
That's not nice, Chuckles.

15
00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:46.410
No, I'm not nice, Chuck.

16
00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:48.631
I'm bad, bad, bad!"

17
00:00:50.352 --> 00:00:51.492
Detective Smith groaned.

18
00:00:51.512 --> 00:00:54.154
"This is terrible."

19
00:00:54.174 --> 00:00:59.136
"I don't know what to get for Dina," Mara said.

20
00:01:00.392 --> 00:01:02.314
Roxy and her friends were at Downtown Toys.

21
00:01:03.114 --> 00:01:04.956
It was the biggest toy store in Metro City.

22
00:01:05.817 --> 00:01:07.278
Mara needed a gift for her cousin.

23
00:01:07.298 --> 00:01:08.959
"How old is Dina?"

24
00:01:09.259 --> 00:01:09.920
Roxy asked.

25
00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:12.722
"She's two years old," Mara said.

26
00:01:12.742 --> 00:01:16.025
"Hmm," Terrell said.

27
00:01:16.045 --> 00:01:18.647
"I wonder what two-year-olds like to do."

28
00:01:19.347 --> 00:01:20.628
Jack grabbed a plastic sword.

29
00:01:20.648 --> 00:01:22.490
"Does Dina like swords?"

30
00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:24.331
Jack swung the sword around.

31
00:01:25.112 --> 00:01:26.493
Then he pretended to fight Terrell.

32
00:01:27.094 --> 00:01:28.575
Terrell laughed and grabbed a sword.

33
00:01:29.436 --> 00:01:30.508
Bonk! Bang!

34
00:01:30.908 --> 00:01:32.489
He and Jack knocked the swords together.

35
00:01:33.429 --> 00:01:34.850
Roxy and Mara rolled their eyes.

36
00:01:34.870 --> 00:01:38.371
"Dina is lots of fun," Mara said.

37
00:01:38.391 --> 00:01:40.391
"I love playing with her.

38
00:01:40.971 --> 00:01:43.652
But I don't know what she does when I'm not around."

39
00:01:43.672 --> 00:01:47.213
"You can get her an art kit," Roxy said.

40
00:01:47.854 --> 00:01:48.534
She picked one up.

41
00:01:48.554 --> 00:01:51.495
"This has pencils, brushes, and paint."

42
00:01:52.775 --> 00:01:53.635
Mara shook her head.

43
00:01:53.655 --> 00:01:55.356
"That's too messy.

44
00:01:56.364 --> 00:02:00.766
The last time Dina came over, she smeared ketchup all over the table.

45
00:02:02.106 --> 00:02:03.767
I don't think she should have paint."

46
00:02:03.787 --> 00:02:09.970
"This store sells musical instruments," Roxy said.

47
00:02:09.990 --> 00:02:13.111
"You could get Dina a recorder or some drums."

48
00:02:14.512 --> 00:02:15.252
Mara snorted.

49
00:02:15.272 --> 00:02:16.772
"No way!

50
00:02:17.373 --> 00:02:19.374
Dina is loud enough already!"

51
00:02:19.394 --> 00:02:23.135
"Oof!" Terrell fell backward into Roxy.

52
00:02:23.875 --> 00:02:25.076
"Sorry!" Terrell said.

53
00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:26.901
"Jack knocked me over."

54
00:02:28.401 --> 00:02:29.442
Jack swung his sword.

55
00:02:30.482 --> 00:02:31.322
Terrell blocked it.

56
00:02:33.063 --> 00:02:33.784
Roxy laughed.

57
00:02:34.604 --> 00:02:37.625
"It's too bad Rocket Girl isn't here, Terrell."

58
00:02:37.645 --> 00:02:39.966
"Why?" Terrell asked.

59
00:02:40.646 --> 00:02:41.447
Roxy smiled.

60
00:02:42.207 --> 00:02:43.728
"She could help you defeat Jack!"

61
00:02:44.848 --> 00:02:45.609
"No way!"

62
00:02:45.789 --> 00:02:46.349
Jack said.

63
00:02:46.369 --> 00:02:48.710
"Even Rocket Girl can't defeat me.

64
00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:51.851
I'm Sir Jack, the bravest knight in the land!"

65
00:02:52.792 --> 00:02:55.445
"Ha!" Terrell leaped toward Jack with his sword.

66
00:02:56.226 --> 00:02:58.307
Roxy grabbed a sword, but then her watch beeped.

67
00:03:01.049 --> 00:03:02.370
She stepped away from her friends.

68
00:03:07.794 --> 00:03:08.975
Bloom?" Roxy said.

69
00:03:08.995 --> 00:03:10.215
"What's wrong?"

70
00:03:11.236 --> 00:03:12.957
"Rocket Girl," Mayor Bloom said.

71
00:03:12.977 --> 00:03:16.200
"I need you to go to Metro City Convention Center.

72
00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:18.881
There's a huge doll show this weekend.

73
00:03:19.602 --> 00:03:22.224
Someone stole some very valuable dolls."

74
00:03:23.328 --> 00:03:25.053
"Don't worry, Mayor," Roxy said.

75
00:03:25.073 --> 00:03:27.860
"Rocket Girl is on her way!"
